{"metadata":{"abstractText":"A series of new 2,5-cycloamino-5H-[1]benzopyrano[4,3-d]pyrimidines 3a-i have been synthesized and tested in vivo for the anti-inflammatory/analgesic/antipyretic effects and in vitro to evaluate the antiplatelet activity on guinea-pig platelet-rich plasma aggregated by collagen, adenosine-5'-diphosphate (ADP) and arachidonic acid (AA). Title compounds were ineffective in vivo; however, the pyrrolidino derivatives 3a and 3c exhibited an antiplatelet activity against all the aggregants differing from that of acetylsalicylic acid (ASA) while the 5-morpholino derivatives 3g-i showed the most potent ASA-like antiplatelet activity.","affiliation":"Dipartimento di Scienze Farmaceutiche, Università degli Studi, Viale Benedetto XV, 3-16132, Genova, Italy. obruno@unige.it","authMan":"N","authorList":{"author":[{"authorAffiliationDetailsList":{"authorAffiliation":[{"affiliation":"Dipartimento di Scienze Farmaceutiche, Università degli Studi, Viale Benedetto XV, 3-16132, Genova, Italy. obruno@unige.it"}]},"firstName":"O","fullName":"Bruno O","initials":"O","lastName":"Bruno"},{"firstName":"C","fullName":"Brullo C","initials":"C","lastName":"Brullo"},{"firstName":"A","fullName":"Ranise A","initials":"A","lastName":"Ranise"},{"firstName":"S","fullName":"Schenone S","initials":"S","lastName":"Schenone"},{"firstName":"F","fullName":"Bondavalli F","initials":"F","lastName":"Bondavalli"},{"firstName":"E","fullName":"Barocelli E","initials":"E","lastName":"Barocelli"},{"firstName":"V","fullName":"Ballabeni V","initials":"V","lastName":"Ballabeni"},{"firstName":"M","fullName":"Chiavarini M","initials":"M","lastName":"Chiavarini"},{"firstName":"M","fullName":"Tognolini M","initials":"M","lastName":"Tognolini"},{"firstName":"M","fullName":"Impicciatore M","initials":"M","lastName":"Impicciatore"}]},"authorString":"Bruno O, Brullo C, Ranise A, Schenone S, Bondavalli F, Barocelli E, Ballabeni V, Chiavarini M, Tognolini M, Impicciatore M.","chemicalList":{"chemic